    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d68">

                <pb facs="0141" n="49" sameAs="frus:frus1943CairoTehran/pg49"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Roosevelt Papers: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Prime Minister Churchill to President
                        Roosevelt</hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d68-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-10-29">29 October 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Former Naval Person to President Roosevelt. Personal and most secret. Nr.
                    477.</p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>Earnestly hope you are making good progress.</item>
                    <pb facs="0142" n="50" xml:id="pg50"/>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>It is very awkward waiting about for an answer from Uncle Joe. It is
                        urgent to get dates settled and preparations made. Anyhow, I hope you and I
                        can meet at <hi rendition="#small-caps">Anfa</hi> between 15th and 20th
                        November. I have a great wish and need to see you. All our troubles and
                        toils are so much easier to face when we are side by side.</item>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>Propose code name see my immediately following msg.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d68-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d68-f1-content">
